  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_01",
      "hash64": "18BBF8C142F9FD38",
      "text": "大家好呀～大家好。\\n我们开始上课吧～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "18BBFBC142FA0251",
      "text": "上一堂课我们\\n提到了蛋有多么宝贵。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_03",
      "hash64": "18BBFAC142FA009E",
      "text": "啊，对了，请问大家\\n平时在使用宝可梦图鉴吗？[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "18BBFDC142FA05B7",
      "text": "从蛋里孵出来的宝可梦\\n也会好～好地被添加到宝可梦图鉴里。\\r\\n大家可以放心哦～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_05",
      "hash64": "18BBFCC142FA0404",
      "text": "嘻嘻……\\n其实，宝可梦图鉴App\\r\\n是我做的。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "18BBFFC142FA091D",
      "text": "虽然是在我来这所学校\\n担任老师的很～久之前……[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_07",
      "hash64": "18BBFEC142FA076A",
      "text": "但我以前是个研究员。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_08",
      "hash64": "18BBF1C142F9F153",
      "text": "那个时候克拉韦尔校长\\n也还不是学校的老师，\\r\\n我和他都在同一个设施里做研究。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_09",
      "hash64": "18BBF0C142F9EFA0",
      "text": "那时我们每天一起研究宝可梦，\\n真的很开心……\\r\\n虽然我总是在挨骂。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_10",
      "hash64": "18B873C142F6E562",
      "text": "哎呀……？我怎么会说起这个？\\n我不是在讲图鉴的事吗～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_11",
      "hash64": "18B874C142F6E715",
      "text": "……对了，今天这堂课是要\\n教大家关于捕捉宝可梦的知识哦。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_12",
      "hash64": "18B871C142F6E1FC",
      "text": "正如大家所知，\\n如果想要捕捉宝可梦，\\r\\n首先是要削弱对方的体力对吧～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_13",
      "hash64": "18B872C142F6E3AF",
      "text": "那么，除了削弱宝可梦的体力以外，\\n大家知不知道其他能够在对战中\\r\\n比较容易捕捉宝可梦的技巧呢？[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_a_03_select_01",
      "hash64": "288E982D51062E98",
      "text": "给它树果",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_a_03_select_02",
      "hash64": "288E9B2D510633B1",
      "text": "让它陷入异常状态",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_a_03_select_03",
      "hash64": "288E9A2D510631FE",
      "text": "让它见识力量的差距",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_answer_01",
      "hash64": "57B2167AC5FF2F01",
      "text": "哎呀呀～？那个也许是\\n其他地区的方法呢～？\\c\\n在帕底亚的认知\\n有一～点不同哦……[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_answer_02",
      "hash64": "57B2137AC5FF29E8",
      "text": "哇～[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n好厉害！回答正确！[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_answer_03",
      "hash64": "57B2147AC5FF2B9B",
      "text": "哇哦～[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n你的想法很狂野呢……\\c\\n派出强大的宝可梦，的确是\\n能让对战进行得比较有利。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_14",
      "hash64": "18B86FC142F6DE96",
      "text": "公布答案。让宝可梦陷入异常状态，\\n就会比较容易捕捉它哦～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_15",
      "hash64": "18B870C142F6E049",
      "text": "尤其是睡眠状态，\\n能够大～幅度地提高捕获率！[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_16",
      "hash64": "18B86DC142F6DB30",
      "text": "只要有催眠粉、催眠术这类\\n能够让对方睡着的招式，\\r\\n就能添加许多宝可梦到图鉴里了～！[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_17",
      "hash64": "18B86EC142F6DCE3",
      "text": "此外，想要提升捕获率的话，\\n也可以针对宝可梦选择适合它的球。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_18",
      "hash64": "18B87BC142F6F2FA",
      "text": "或者通过吃东西获得捕获力，\\n另外也可以从宝可梦的身后展开对战。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_19",
      "hash64": "18B87CC142F6F4AD",
      "text": "如果你在捕捉宝可梦时感觉到瓶颈，\\n可以去闯道馆收集道馆徽章。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_20",
      "hash64": "18B4EDC142F3CBD9",
      "text": "提升自己能捕捉的宝可梦的等级\\n也是相当重要的哦～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_21",
      "hash64": "18B4ECC142F3CA26",
      "text": "当宝可梦图鉴填得差不多时，请务必！\\n拿来给吉尼亚老师我看看哦～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_22",
      "hash64": "18B4EBC142F3C873",
      "text": "今天也很开心呢。\\n下一堂课要考试哦～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
